Focal
=====

Focal is a library and image-viewing application for RISC OS.

Click its iconbar icon to open the library. Drag an image to the iconbar icon
to open it directly in a viewer, or add folders to the persistent library from
the library window.

Double-click a library thumbnail to open it in a viewer. Use the viewer toolbar
or keyboard controls to navigate, fit the image to the window, display it at
100%, enter full-screen mode, or hide the toolbar.
